  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Changjiang/Pearl River Watershed Rehabilitation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The two highly interlinked project development objectives are to (i) improve farmer&apos;s livelihoods and (ii) protect the environment in poor and highly degraded watersheds of the Changjiang and Pearl River Basins by promoting an integrated and replicable model of sustainable rural development.</narrative>
  </description>
